    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Duffy is delighted to present this exceptional residential site, Site B at Toomes, Co. Louth, to the market. Extending to approximately 0.38 acres, this prime parcel of rural land offers a fantastic opportunity to design and build a bespoke forever home in a highly scenic and sought-after countryside location.\n\nThe site is being offered for sale subject to planning permission, with local needs applying, providing an ideal foundation for a custom family residence.\n\nSituated in the tranquil setting of Toomes along the road towards Stonetown, the site offers the perfect balance of peaceful rural living and everyday family convenience. It is located just a 20 minute drive from Dundalk town centre via the Carrick Road, placing local primary schools in nearby Knockbridge and Inniskeen within easy reach, along with Dundalk's secondary schools, shops, and services. The surrounding area is rich in community amenities, including Stephenstown Pond, the Patrick Kavanagh Centre, vibrant local GAA clubs, and quick access to the M1 motorway network.\n\nContact DNG Duffy today for more information.\n\nNote: Potential purchasers are specifically advised to verify the floor areas as part of their due diligence. Pictures/maps/dimensions are for illustration purposes only and potential purchasers should satisfy themselves of final finish and unit/land areas. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only. The property is sold as seen and a purchaser is to satisfy themselves of same when bidding."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Paul Clarke"
      }
